      "content": "Hey, i'm working on a feasibility report for moving some of our assembly lines out of China. we're looking at options in Vietnam/SE Asia, maybe some parts of Nigeria or Kenya, and also some sites in Poland or Romania. can u give me a quick breakdown of the labor profiles for these areas? specifically looking at things like typical work ethic, how reliable the workforce is for high-precision stuff, and what the management style/oversight requirements usually look like in those regions? thanks",
